<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef higher on light to moderate demand and light offerings. Select and Choice chuck, round and loin cuts higher, while rib cuts firm. Beef trimmings firm on light demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>115 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p>  7 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>15 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     103.49	102.84	 98.54	 98.46</p>
<p>Changes	  0.98	  1.06	  0.83	  1.33</p>
<p>Rib	  154.84	151.54	143.06	144.41</p>
<p>Chuck	 71.26	 68.72	 71.75	 69.76</p>
